- Build distinct Cursor profiles rather than one generic workspace-write builder:
  - `review-ask`: `--trust --mode ask --output-format json`, model arguments after output format, workspace, then prompt; never `--force`.
  - `ci-write`: `--force --trust`, model arguments before `--output-format json`, workspace, then prompt.
  - `implement-write`: `--force --trust --output-format json`, model arguments after output format, workspace, then prompt.
